  "content": "<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://github.com/UnhappyCodings/thoriumreactors/raw/1.20.1/thumbnail.png\" alt=\"ThoriumReactors Thumbnail\" width=\"664\" height=\"194\"></span></p>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">ThoriumReactors 模组是一款 Minecraft Forge 模组，为游戏引入了全新的能量生成方式。</span></h5>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">利用钚的力量，为您的我的世界世界提供可持续且高效的能源！</span></h5>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">包含多种矿石、资源、机器、配方、模组集成、进度成就、涡轮机等等更多内容！</span></h5>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdocs.thorium-reactors.de%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Documentation-5abcff?style=for-the-badge&logoColor=white&logo=GitBook\" alt=\"Documentation badge\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\"></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.intelligence-modding.de%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Join_Discord-5865F2?style=for-the-badge&logoColor=white&logo=Discord\" alt=\"Discord badge\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\"></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://github.com/IntelligenceModding/thoriumreactors/blob/1.20.1/CERTIFICATE.pdf\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Thor_Approved-43E000?style=for-the-badge&logoColor=white&logo=checkmarx\" alt=\"Thor Approved badge\" width=\"156\" height=\"28\"></a></span></p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></h4>\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\n<h4><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>功能特色</strong></span></h4>\n<h4><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">- 探索地下深处，发现多达 11 种矿石和矿物。</span><br><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">- 建造您自己的钚反应堆。为反应堆添加燃料，让物理学的魔力开始运作</span><br><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">- 通过大型控制界面监控整个反应堆，确保稳定性、效率和持续发电。<br>- 利用产生的蒸汽驱动您的涡轮机，实现无限发电。<br>- 深入地下开采多种矿石和资源<br>- 完成所有进度成就。<br>- 还有更多惊喜！现在就来试试吧！</span></h4>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></h4>\n<h4><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>整合包</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">- 您可以自由在任何整合包中使用此模组</span></h4>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>",
